        "liquid": "{%- comment -%} MOTORTECH — Guarantees + Footer sections {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign logo_url = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0752/5403/8702/files/image_2026-06-05_005144225.png?v=1780613508\" -%}\n\n<style>\n  #mt-ext{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;width:100vw;position:relative;left:50%;right:50%;margin-left:-50vw;margin-right:-50vw;background:#fff;}\n  #mt-ext *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n\n  /* ── Guarantees ── */\n  .mt-guar{background:#F4F7FA;padding:56px 24px;width:100%;}\n  .mt-guar-inner{max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 48px;}\n  .mt-guar-eyebrow{display:block;text-align:center;color:#1E93CF;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;}\n  .mt-guar-title{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;text-align:center;color:#0F1620;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:10px;}\n  .mt-guar-sub{text-align:center;color:#566472;font-size:15px;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 44px;}\n  .mt-guar-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;}\n  .mt-guar-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4E9EF;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 18px 22px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;}\n  .mt-guar-icon{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:#E9F6FC;border:1px solid #C4E6F5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;}\n  .mt-guar-icon svg{width:28px;height:28px;stroke:#1E93CF;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  .mt-guar-name{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#0F1620;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.3px;}\n  .mt-guar-desc{font-size:13px;color:#566472;line-height:1.55;}\n  @media(max-width:760px){.mt-guar-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;}}\n\n  /* ── Footer ── */\n  .mt-ft{background:#0B0D11;color:#A7B0BD;padding:52px 24px 0;width:100%;}\n  .mt-ft-inner{max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 48px;}\n  .mt-ft-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:60px;padding-bottom:44px;align-items:start;}\n  .mt-ft-logo img{height:52px;width:auto;display:block;}\n  .mt-ft-tagline{font-size:14px;color:#A7B0BD;margin-top:14px;max-width:300px;line-height:1.65;}\n  .mt-ft-col h4{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.7px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:16px;}\n  .mt-ft-badges{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}\n  .mt-ft-badge{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#fff;font-weight:600;}\n  .mt-ft-badge svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:#1E93CF;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex:none;}\n  .mt-ft-divider{border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);}\n  .mt-ft-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;padding:18px 0;}\n  .mt-ft-copy{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.38);}\n  .mt-ft-pills{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n  .mt-ft-pill{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);}\n  @media(max-width:760px){.mt-guar-inner,.mt-ft-inner{padding:0 20px;}.mt-ft-top{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px;}.mt-ft-bottom{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}}\n</style>\n\n<div id=\"mt-ext\">\n\n  <!-- ══ Guarantees ══ -->\n  <section class=\"mt-guar\">\n    <div class=\"mt-guar-inner\">\n      <span class=\"mt-guar-eyebrow\">Our Promise</span>\n      <h2 class=\"mt-guar-title\">Our Guarantees</h2>\n      <p class=\"mt-guar-sub\">Every order is backed by our commitment to quality, speed, and your complete satisfaction.</p>\n      <div class=\"mt-guar-grid\">\n\n        <div class=\"mt-guar-card\">\n          <div class=\"mt-guar-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 10 4.5-2 8-5 8-10V6z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-guar-name\">Quality Assured</div>\n          <p class=\"mt-guar-desc\">Every product is tested and inspected before it reaches you — no compromises.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mt-guar-card\">\n          <div class=\"mt-guar-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M1 3h15v13H1zM16 8h4l3 3v5h-7\"/><circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-guar-name\">Lebanon Delivery</div>\n          <p class=\"mt-guar-desc\">We deliver to every region across Lebanon — fast, reliable, and tracked.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mt-guar-card\">\n          <div class=\"mt-guar-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M2 10h20\"/><path d=\"M7 15h2\"/><path d=\"M11 15h4\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-guar-name\">Cash on Delivery</div>\n          <p class=\"mt-guar-desc\">Pay when your order arrives — no online payment required, no risk for you.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mt-guar-card\">\n          <div class=\"mt-guar-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 8v4l3 2\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-guar-name\">Easy to Use</div>\n          <p class=\"mt-guar-desc\">All our products are designed for a simple, effortless experience — no expertise needed.</p>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══ Footer ══ -->\n  <footer class=\"mt-ft\">\n    <div class=\"mt-ft-inner\">\n      <div class=\"mt-ft-top\">\n\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"mt-ft-logo\">\n            {%- if logo_url != blank -%}\n              <img src=\"{{ logo_url }}\" alt=\"{{ shop.name | escape }}\">\n            {%- elsif shop.brand.logo -%}\n              <img src=\"{{ shop.brand.logo | image_url: width: 300 }}\" alt=\"{{ shop.name | escape }}\">\n            {%- else -%}\n              <span style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#fff;\">Motor<span style=\"color:#1E93CF;\">Tech</span></span>\n            {%- endif -%}\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"mt-ft-tagline\">Premium automotive accessories built for drivers who take their vehicle seriously.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mt-ft-col\">\n          <h4>Why MotorTech</h4>\n          <div class=\"mt-ft-badges\">\n            <div class=\"mt-ft-badge\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 10 4.5-2 8-5 8-10V6z\"/></svg>\n              Quality tested products\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-ft-badge\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M1 3h15v13H1zM16 8h4l3 3v5h-7\"/><circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg>\n              Delivery all over Lebanon\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-ft-badge\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M2 10h20\"/></svg>\n              Cash on delivery\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"mt-ft-divider\">\n      <div class=\"mt-ft-bottom\">\n        <p class=\"mt-ft-copy\">© {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} {{ shop.name }}. All rights reserved.</p>\n        <div class=\"mt-ft-pills\">\n          <span class=\"mt-ft-pill\">COD</span>\n          <span class=\"mt-ft-pill\">Lebanon Delivery</span>\n          <span class=\"mt-ft-pill\">Lebanon 🇱🇧</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</div>",
        "add_vertical_spacing": false,
        "background_type": "full_width",
        "background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
        "text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)"
      }
    }
